flowchart TD
  A[Start: Ansible Role] --> B[Initialize & Validate]
  B --> C[Gather Facts]
  C --> D{For each disk}

  D --> E[Merge defaults & validate config]
  E --> F{Disk already configured?}

  F -->|Yes - Preserve existing| G[Use existing device path from fact]
  F -->|No - New disk| H[Discover/create device paths]

  G --> I[Safety checks]
  H --> I

  I --> J{Needs provisioning?}
  J -->|No - state: absent| K[Cleanup: unmount & remove config]
  J -->|Yes| L[Provision disk]

  subgraph Provision [Disk Provisioning]
    L --> L1{LVM enabled?}
    L1 -->|Yes| L2[Create VG/LV]
    L1 -->|No| L3[Use raw device]
    L2 --> L4[Format filesystem]
    L3 --> L4
    L4 --> L5{Mount method?}
    L5 -->|systemd| L6[Create systemd unit]
    L5 -->|fstab| L7[Add to /etc/fstab]
    L6 --> L8[Mount volume]
    L7 --> L8
  end

  L8 --> M[Update configuration record]
  K --> M

  M --> N{More disks?}
  N -->|Yes| D
  N -->|No| O[Write disk_part.fact]
  O --> P[Complete]

  Note1[mount_path_type: auto ensures<br/>idempotent device path handling]
  Note1 -.-> F
  Note1 -.-> G

  Note2[Supports: ext4, xfs, btrfs, swap<br/>Mount types: systemd, fstab]
  Note2 -.-> L4
  Note2 -.-> L5

  classDef decision fill:#334155,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#f8fafc;
  classDef action fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#f8fafc;
  classDef terminal fill:#0f172a,stroke:#22c55e,color:#f8fafc;
  classDef data fill:#475569,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#f8fafc;

  class A,B,C,E,G,H,I,K,L,L2,L3,L4,L6,L7,L8,M,O action;
  class D,F,J,L1,L5,N decision;
  class P terminal;
  class Note1,Note2 data;
